desc: The classic finger warm-up: frets 1, 2, 3, 4 on every string, one finger per fret from index to pinky. Go up, then come back down.|经典的手指热身: 每根弦依次按 1、2、3、4 品, 食指到小指一指一品. 先上行再下行.
desc: Tip: if it is too fast, set the speed to 50%; keep the fingers you just used close to the strings.|小贴士: 太快跟不上就把速度调到 50%; 按下一个品时, 前面的手指尽量不要抬太高.
